Package: kilix-llm
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, ${misc:Depends}
Description: local language-model launcher
 kilix-llm installs its modules, pin, and scripts under /usr/share/kilix-llm.
 The command uses the system Python interpreter. Model weights and the
 llama.cpp sources stay outside the package.
